{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Hatiwal Light v2 (fa)",
  "metadata": {
    "hatiwal:purpose": "Search-surface basemap. Deliberately quiet: the LISTINGS are the content and this is the backdrop. Brand gold (#E8B23A) is absent on purpose — it belongs to the price markers drawn on top, and a gold-flecked basemap would make them stop standing out.",
    "hatiwal:labels": "name:fa → name:nonlatin → name → name:latin. name:ps and name:ur EXIST in these tiles (built with --languages=ps,fa,en,ur); before that ps fell back to Dari script and Urdu was absent entirely.",
    "hatiwal:palette": "v2 depth palette (docs/design/MAP_V2.md): warm limestone light, brand-navy dark, hillshade + building shadows + extrusion.",
    "hatiwal:generated": "build-styles.mjs — do NOT hand-edit a style file; edit the generator and re-run it, then `node test/render-test.mjs` (18/18)."
  },
